-- Migration: Bloom's L3 rebalancing — FAR batch 3 (25 questions)
-- Date: 2026-02-21
-- Purpose: Rewrite 25 L2 (Application) questions to L3 (Analysis) depth for FAR section
-- Affected topics: Special Purpose Frameworks, Statement of Cash Flows, Contingencies, Earnings Per Share, Accounting Changes and Error Corrections, Governmental Accounting Fundamentals, Conceptual Framework and Standards, Payables and Accrued Liabilities

BEGIN;

